<title>PERU: Cementos Lima announces dividend.</title>
<headline>Cementos Lima announces dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's largest cement producer, Cementos Lima, announced a dividend of $0.23 per common share and $0.023 per labor share, according to a Lima Exchange report Monday.</p>
<p>The bolsa said the record date is February 4 and the payout date February 13.</p>
<p>The dividends, totalling $6.9 million and based on 1996 profits, will apply to 26.46 million common shares and 34.18 million labor shares.</p>
<p>((-- Eduardo Orozco, Lima Newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
